		},
		{
			"id":"139779754585732a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [[Murphy Stormwind|Lord Find-It-All]]\nThe party may enlist the help of [[Murphy Stormwind]] to locate the [[The Clone Golem]] or the [[The Clone Golem#The Valentina Tunic|The Valentina Tunic]]",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1480,
			"y":480,
			"width":280,
			"height":300,
			"color":"#c8bd89"
		},
		{
			"id":"933200491d47b975",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [[Uncovering The Truth]]\n\nAfter the characters interrogate Nabulee’s staff and explore his house, they’ll most certainly want some explanations that the Calishite won’t be able to provide. Eventually, the adventurers will understand that someone who looked just like Nabulee entered the vault, and that someone erased the merchant’s memory.",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1570,
			"y":80,
			"width":1040,
			"height":160,
			"color":"#664edf"
		},
		{
			"id":"564c9ecc4d896814",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [[Bernard Kothont]]\nCan help your players by offering ways to confirm their theories and evidence",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1800,
			"y":480,
			"width":260,
			"height":300,
			"color":"#cfc2a5"
		},
		{
			"id":"ccecbab8a3a67328",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [[The Clone Golem]]\nThe PCs attempt to track down the Golem that is impersonating Nabulee",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2080,
			"y":480,
			"width":280,
			"height":140,
			"color":"#f07400"
		},
		{
			"id":"84515c3a1bb36cf9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [[The Clone Golem#The Valentina Tunic|The Valentina Tunic]]\nCan be found with a *locate object* spell, and used to track the clone golem using scent or a *locate creature* spell once identififed",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2400,
			"y":480,
			"width":320,
			"height":280,
			"color":"#8900fa"
		},
