			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-720,
			"y":-280,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"56c4ac25cee340b5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [[The Man In the Street]]\n\nThe players find the body of [[Aaron Littlehorn]], killed by the [[Scarab Of Death (item)]]\n\n> [!important]- Fast Facts\n> ![[The Man In the Street#Fast Facts]]\n\n> [!NOTE]- Characters\n> ![[The Man In the Street#Characters]]",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-720,
			"y":-160,
			"width":680,
			"height":340
		},
		{
			"id":"77ab847b55a5e48b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [[Returning to the Bazaar]]\n\nIf the PCs leave and come back to the Bazaar, Nabulee is pacing inside and suggests visiting [[Nabulee’s Bazaar of the Extraordinary Vault Room map|the Vault]]. ",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-200,
			"y":300,
			"width":320,
			"height":240
		},
		{
			"id":"40d6cd3263d01a9a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## [[Concluding The Adventure#Tomb Raiders|Tomb Raiders]]",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4260,
			"y":240,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"25601750ae232750",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## [[Concluding The Adventure#The Blood Pact|The Blood Pact]]",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4260,
			"y":420,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"fc0fbd8f35028aba",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## [[Concluding The Adventure#The Grand Auction|The Grand Auction]]",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":4260,
			"y":310,
			"width":260,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"837e0c9e139d2227",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [[Interrogating the Staff]]\nThe PCs may interrogate the staff of the auction house and learn that Nabulee got into an argument with someone that morning, and was spotted wearing a bloody shirt.\n> [!NOTE]- Characters\n> ![[Interrogating the Staff#Characters]]\n\n> [!attention]- Fast Facts\n> ![[Interrogating the Staff#Fast Facts]]\n\n> [!TIP]- The Housekeeper\n> ![[Interrogating the Staff#The Housekeeper]]\n\n> [!tip]- The Butler\n> ![[Interrogating the Staff#The Butler]]\n",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":920,
			"y":240,
			"width":460,
			"height":540
		},
		{
			"id":"9e435f468a9a740b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [[Securing the Job]]\n\nThe party will need to make sure [[Lord Archibald Littlehorn]] does not get in the way of their investiation. They may do this by [[The Cover Up|covering up]] his son's death, or by talking to him and securing time to complete their investigation\n\n> [!attention]- Fast Facts\n> \n> ![[Securing the Job#Fast Facts]]\n\n> [!NOTE]- Characters\n> ![[Securing the Job#Characters]]",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-660,
			"y":620,
			"width":680,
			"height":320
		},
		{
			"id":"e3c62bfb0141d6a5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [[The Investigation]]\nThe players will want to interview Nabulee and inspect his vault, as he claims *his* scarab of death is safely locked there.\n\n> [!NOTE]- Characters\n> ![[The Investigation#Characters]]\n\n> [!attention]- A Guided Tour\n> ![[Interrogating the Staff#⚠️ A Guided Tour]]",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":440,
			"y":-250,
			"width":780,
			"height":400
		},
		{
			"id":"9069613bdc10b86b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# [[The Auction House]]\n\nThe party searches Nabulee’s house for clues that might shed some light on what happened to Aaron. \n\n> [!NOTE]- Characters\n> ![[The Auction House#Characters]]\n\n> [!warning]- Encounter Description\n> ![[The Auction House#Encounter Description]]",
			"dynamicHeight":true,
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":430,
			"y":240,
			"width":400,
			"height":420
		},
		{"id":"d1c5858a991c16a1","type":"text","text":"> [!NOTE] Evidence\n> ![[Uncovering The Truth#Evidence]]","x":2117,"y":-840,"width":567,"height":830}
